WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.124 --> 00:00:09.206
"Morb took them!"

2
00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:16.128
Perda hissed into Zann's ear.

3
00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:18.148
"He took the king and queen!"

4
00:00:18.168 --> 00:00:23.610
"Yeah." Zann held on to the bars at the end of the tunnel and peered into the room

5
00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:24.510
inside the palace.

6
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:25.530
"I saw."

7
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.591
Zann didn't know what to think.

8
00:00:27.911 --> 00:00:30.091
He'd been counting on the king and queen to help them.

9
00:00:30.872 --> 00:00:31.732
Now they were gone.

10
00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:32.973
Just like his parents.

11
00:00:33.313 --> 00:00:34.154
Just like Boz.

12
00:00:34.174 --> 00:00:36.096
"Look," Darb said.

13
00:00:36.116 --> 00:00:37.437
"Everyone's waking up."

14
00:00:38.798 --> 00:00:40.420
The people in the room were stirring.

15
00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:44.623
A woman with sleek, dark hair sat up, looking confused.

16
00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:46.285
"Your Majesties?"

17
00:00:46.685 --> 00:00:47.246
she called out.

18
00:00:48.026 --> 00:00:50.208
A man who had been frozen shook off the spell.

19
00:00:50.829 --> 00:00:55.673
He was tall, broad-shouldered, and young, with a friendly face and spiky blond hair.

20
00:00:55.693 --> 00:00:58.876
"The king and queen are gone," he said hoarsely.

21
00:00:59.624 --> 00:01:00.405
"I saw it happen.

22
00:01:00.725 --> 00:01:03.286
A man zapped in with a bunch of trolls and took them."

23
00:01:04.347 --> 00:01:04.907
"What man?"

24
00:01:05.207 --> 00:01:05.848
the woman asked.

25
00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:07.849
"His name is Morb!"

26
00:01:08.129 --> 00:01:08.929
Perda called out.

27
00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:10.990
The man and woman spun around.

28
00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:11.871
"Who said that?"

29
00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:12.771
the man asked.

30
00:01:12.791 --> 00:01:15.393
"We're in here," Zann called.

31
00:01:16.053 --> 00:01:18.955
By now most of the other people in the room were awake too.

32
00:01:19.715 --> 00:01:22.797
A man with a pale, narrow face looked down sharply.

33
00:01:22.817 --> 00:01:24.958
"Rixa, Yog!

34
00:01:25.338 --> 00:01:26.279
Don't go over there!"

35
00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.060
he said with a suspicious frown.

36
00:01:28.924 --> 00:01:30.265
"It could be a trap."

37
00:01:30.285 --> 00:01:32.946
"It's not a trap," Gliss said.

38
00:01:32.966 --> 00:01:34.227
"We're just kids.

39
00:01:35.048 --> 00:01:36.488
Please let us out of this tunnel."

40
00:01:36.508 --> 00:01:38.770
"Can't you zap yourselves out?"

41
00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:40.471
the woman, Rixa, asked.

42
00:01:40.491 --> 00:01:44.073
"We can't use magic right now," Zann said.

43
00:01:44.093 --> 00:01:49.956
"If you let us out, we'll explain everything, including who took the king and queen."

44
00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:52.477
"How would you know that?"

45
00:01:52.977 --> 00:01:54.018
the pale man retorted.

46
00:01:54.038 --> 00:01:57.340
"Relax, Slib," the young man, Yog, said.

47
00:01:57.696 --> 00:01:58.837
"Let's hear what they have to say."

48
00:01:59.517 --> 00:02:01.958
He snapped his fingers and the bars melted away.

49
00:02:02.738 --> 00:02:06.680
Zing was so relieved to be out of the tunnel that he flew around whistling.

50
00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.741
"Thanks," Zann said.

51
00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:15.563
"We were trying to reach the king and queen so we could—" "Hold on, young man," Slib interrupted.

52
00:02:16.244 --> 00:02:18.745
He rubbed his hands together and then pointed at the kids.

53
00:02:19.565 --> 00:02:21.546
"Reveal," he intoned.

54
00:02:22.346 --> 00:02:26.268
Zann felt a spark run through him, and Gliss let out a squeak of surprise.

55
00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.922
Suddenly their red hair and freckles were visible again!

56
00:02:30.723 --> 00:02:32.444
The adults murmured in amazement.

57
00:02:33.204 --> 00:02:34.025
"You're Reds!"

58
00:02:34.505 --> 00:02:35.346
Rixa exclaimed.

59
00:02:35.366 --> 00:02:37.607
"How have you escaped the trolls?"

60
00:02:37.627 --> 00:02:39.909
"That's not important."

61
00:02:40.289 --> 00:02:41.530
Zann pulled out the diary.

62
00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:44.492
"We need to show you what's in this diary.

63
00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:47.534
It belongs to my grandfather, Boz.

64
00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:51.557
He's a retired Magic Master, and—" "Boz?"

65
00:02:51.957 --> 00:02:53.038
an older man interrupted.

66
00:02:53.058 --> 00:02:56.000
"Did you say Boz is your grandfather?"

67
00:02:56.768 --> 00:02:59.490
Suddenly everyone in the room was staring at Zann.

68
00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.971
"Um, yeah," he said.

69
00:03:01.991 --> 00:03:03.072
"Do you know him?"

70
00:03:04.112 --> 00:03:04.913
Rixa chuckled.

71
00:03:04.933 --> 00:03:07.534
"We all know Boz.

72
00:03:08.335 --> 00:03:11.116
He was one of the finest advisers ever to serve at the palace.

73
00:03:11.837 --> 00:03:15.358
When the last queen retired, the current king and queen begged him to stay.

74
00:03:15.659 --> 00:03:17.960
But Boz wanted to spend more time with his family."

75
00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:20.241
"Boz worked at the palace?"

76
00:03:20.621 --> 00:03:21.842
Perda glanced at Zann.

77
00:03:22.182 --> 00:03:23.323
"You never told me that."

78
00:03:23.343 --> 00:03:25.024
"I didn't know."

79
00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.581
Zann could hardly believe his ears.

80
00:03:28.861 --> 00:03:32.002
He knew that his grandfather had once been a powerful Magic Master.

81
00:03:32.682 --> 00:03:35.803
But Boz had never mentioned that he'd also been a royal adviser.

82
00:03:36.543 --> 00:03:38.484
Zann didn't have much time to think about it though.

83
00:03:39.124 --> 00:03:41.585
Almost everyone was rushing over to ask him questions.

84
00:03:42.325 --> 00:03:48.086
Zann introduced himself and his friends, explained how Boz had been taken, and started to tell the adults

85
00:03:48.126 --> 00:03:48.767
about Morb.

86
00:03:48.787 --> 00:03:53.128
"I've heard enough," Slib interrupted after a few minutes.

87
00:03:53.492 --> 00:03:56.094
"This Morb fellow sounds dangerous.

88
00:03:56.895 --> 00:04:00.819
We need to decide who's going to take over until the king and queen return."

89
00:04:01.679 --> 00:04:02.840
Rixa looked uneasy.

90
00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.562
"Let's not be hasty."

91
00:04:04.582 --> 00:04:09.386
"I won't sit here and wait for something even worse to happen," Slib said.

92
00:04:09.406 --> 00:04:12.949
"We must protect the citizens of Magica."

93
00:04:12.969 --> 00:04:16.352
"Boz seemed to think there might be answers in here."

94
00:04:16.792 --> 00:04:18.254
Zann held up the diary again.

95
00:04:19.054 --> 00:04:19.855
Slib grabbed it.

96
00:04:20.235 --> 00:04:22.920
"Fine. Now come along, children.

97
00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:23.981
I'll show you out."

98
00:04:24.001 --> 00:04:26.501
"No!" Yog looked alarmed.

99
00:04:26.521 --> 00:04:28.162
"They won't be safe on the streets."

100
00:04:28.902 --> 00:04:30.683
"He's right," another man said.

101
00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:32.883
"Boz would want us to protect them."

102
00:04:32.903 --> 00:04:36.984
"Besides, we haven't told you everything we know," Perda put in.

103
00:04:37.004 --> 00:04:42.106
"We've seen Morb a bunch of times and—" "Yes, yes."

104
00:04:42.686 --> 00:04:43.846
Slib sounded impatient.

105
00:04:43.866 --> 00:04:45.446
"Come with me then.

106
00:04:45.907 --> 00:04:48.507
We'll go somewhere more private to discuss it."

107
00:04:48.527 --> 00:04:50.728
"Good idea," Yog said.

108
00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:51.661
"I'll come too.

109
00:04:52.341 --> 00:04:54.443
I'd like to talk more with Boz's grandson."

110
00:04:54.723 --> 00:04:55.703
He smiled at Zann.

111
00:04:56.424 --> 00:04:59.646
"I was only a boy when Boz was here, but he was always kind to me."

112
00:05:00.427 --> 00:05:01.187
Rixa nodded.

113
00:05:01.207 --> 00:05:02.308
"I'll come as well.

114
00:05:02.989 --> 00:05:05.110
I know the perfect spot for such a conversation.

115
00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:06.011
Follow me."

116
00:05:08.833 --> 00:05:09.813
Slib looked annoyed.

117
00:05:09.833 --> 00:05:11.555
"Where are we going?"

118
00:05:12.015 --> 00:05:15.878
he asked as Rixa led him, the kids, and Yog down a hallway.

119
00:05:16.698 --> 00:05:18.780
Zing flew along just above Zann's head.

120
00:05:19.444 --> 00:05:21.125
"You'll see—we're almost there."

121
00:05:21.846 --> 00:05:26.849
Rixa led the way into a large sitting room, filled with fancy decorations and exotic furniture.

122
00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:31.492
Two doors on the far side of the room opened into equally luxurious bedrooms.

123
00:05:31.512 --> 00:05:33.754
"Wow, this place is nice!"

124
00:05:34.234 --> 00:05:34.735
said Gliss.

125
00:05:34.755 --> 00:05:37.757
"Please relax, kids," Rixa said.

126
00:05:37.777 --> 00:05:40.318
"You'll be safe here while we figure out what to do."

127
00:05:41.019 --> 00:05:43.100
For a moment Zann didn't understand.

128
00:05:43.801 --> 00:05:48.244
Then he noticed Rixa and Yog backing out of the room, pulling Slib along with them.

129
00:05:48.992 --> 00:05:50.193
"Wait!" Perda said.

130
00:05:50.213 --> 00:05:51.373
"Where are you going?"

131
00:05:51.393 --> 00:05:54.594
"This is for your own protection," Rixa said.

132
00:05:54.614 --> 00:05:57.035
"No!" Zann protested.

133
00:05:57.056 --> 00:05:58.976
"You can't shut us in here!"

134
00:06:00.037 --> 00:06:01.417
Yog smiled kindly.

135
00:06:01.437 --> 00:06:03.798
"Please don't try to use magic to get out.

136
00:06:04.479 --> 00:06:06.139
You already told us it's not safe for you."

137
00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:11.282
"Besides, this suite is protected by extra-strong Shield spells," Rixa added.

138
00:06:11.302 --> 00:06:14.583
"Nobody can zap in or out without knowing the password."

139
00:06:15.343 --> 00:06:17.265
"Wait!" cried Zann.

140
00:06:17.326 --> 00:06:19.266
But the door had already slammed shut.
